{"id": "1b17e4a3-aa30-4865-a146-28eb447939ac", "slug": "aether-architects", "title": "Aether / Architects", "description": "Aether Architects UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Aether / Architects\"\ndescription: \"Aether Architects UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#52525B\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#52525B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#52525B\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aether / Architects\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 24; favorites: 5; remixes: 1.\nTags: footer, bento, cta, animated, webgl, navigation, legal, links.\n## Overview\nAether Architects UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #52525B, accent #FFFFFF, background #050505, surface #52525B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aether / Architects</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        zinc: { 850: '#1f1f22', 950: '#09090b' } // Custom darks\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-zinc-300 min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white/20\">\n\n    <!-- Navbar / Top Brand -->\n    <nav class=\"w-full border-b border-white/10 relative z-20\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:atom-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>AETHER / OS</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500\">\n                <span class=\"hidden sm:block\">SYS.VER.4.0.2</span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\"></span>\n                    ONLINE\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout with Vertical Container Lines -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto border-l border-r border-white/5 relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n\n        <!-- Decoration: Corner Squares for Container Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-white z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-white z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-white z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-white z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Section 01: Hypercube -->\n        <div class=\"group relative border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between h-[600px] lg:h-[800px] hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors duration-700\">\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-semibold tracking-tight font-sans\">Quantum Lattice</span>\n                <span>01//</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Description Top -->\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[280px]\">\n                The central framework of the lattice contains patterns of creation. It maps the glyphs that shape matter and energy in the void.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Visual (Canvas) -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-12\">\n                <canvas id=\"canvas1\" class=\"w-full max-w-[300px] aspect-square opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n                <!-- Axis Labels -->\n                <span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 text-[10px] text-zinc-700 font-mono -translate-y-1/2\">Energy</span>\n                <span class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 text-[10px] text-zinc-700 font-mono -translate-y-1/2\">Matter</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-4\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-2\">Protocol: Genesis</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Aether empowers you to challenge limits of the real and digital world. Finding wonders most will never know exist.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Mini Grid Decor -->\n                <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 grid-rows-3 gap-[1px] bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-800 w-24 h-16 opacity-50\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full\"></div></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-950\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600\">\n                    <span>Aether.sys</span>\n                    <span>C-XX.XX.9001</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 02: Logic Cylinders -->\n        <div class=\"group relative border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between h-[600px] lg:h-[800px] hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors duration-700\">\n            <!-- Gradient Border Effect (Top) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent lg:hidden\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-semibold tracking-tight font-sans\">Neural Syntax</span>\n                <span>02//</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[280px]\">\n                XP derives from ancient computation. A monogram formed by the intersection of logic gates and sacred symbols.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-12\">\n                <canvas id=\"canvas2\" class=\"w-full max-w-[300px] aspect-square opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n                <!-- Floating Glyphs -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center gap-16 pointer-events-none\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-scan-linear\" class=\"text-white/20 text-4xl animate-[pulse_4s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-white/20 text-4xl animate-[pulse_4s_ease-in-out_infinite] animation-delay-2000\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-right\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-[240px] ml-auto\">\n                        In Aether, XP is transfigured: it bridges the gap between the sacred and the gamified. The unifying mark of digital progression.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600 pt-12 border-t border-white/5\">\n                    <span>Aether.sys</span>\n                    <span>LOG.KERNEL.PANIC</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 03: Esoteric Sphere -->\n        <div class=\"group relative p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between h-[600px] lg:h-[800px] hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors duration-700\">\n             <!-- Gradient Border Effect (Top) -->\n             <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent lg:hidden\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span class=\"text-zinc-300 font-semibold tracking-tight font-sans\">Harmonic Resonance</span>\n                <span>03//</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[280px]\">\n                \"Resonance\" refers to the connection and attraction of experiences, thoughts, or people that vibrate at the same frequency.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-12\">\n                <canvas id=\"canvas3\" class=\"w-full max-w-[300px] aspect-square opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                 <div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-4\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white mb-2\">Status: Aligned</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Resonance: XP = the intersection between spirit (transcendence) and matter (experience). Aligning with deepest energies.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700 bg-white/20\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-700\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span>Aether.sys</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Interface Bar -->\n    <footer class=\"w-full border-t border-white/10 bg-zinc-950 relative z-20\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-12 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-zinc-600 uppercase\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <span>Latency: 4ms</span>\n                <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Encryption: AES-256</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Privacy</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Terms</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Manifesto</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- WebGL-like Canvas Animation Script -->\n    <script>\n        class WireframeEngine {\n            constructor(canvasId, shapeType) {\n                this.canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n                this.ctx = this.canvas.getContext('2d');\n                this.width = this.canvas.offsetWidth;\n                this.height = this.canvas.offsetHeight;\n                this.canvas.width = this.width * 2; // Retina scale\n                this.canvas.height = this.height * 2;\n                this.ctx.scale(2, 2);\n                this.cx = this.width / 2;\n                this.cy = this.height / 2;\n                this.shapeType = shapeType;\n\n                this.points = [];\n                this.edges = [];\n                this.angleX = 0;\n                this.angleY = 0;\n\n                this.initShape();\n                this.animate();\n            }\n\n            initShape() {\n                if (this.shapeType === 'cube') {\n                    // Merkaba-ish (Two tetrahedrons)\n                    const s = 80;\n                    // Tetrahedron 1\n                    this.points.push({x: s, y: s, z: s}, {x: -s, y: -s, z: s}, {x: -s, y: s, z: -s}, {x: s, y: -s, z: -s});\n                    // Tetrahedron 2 (Inverted)\n                    this.points.push({x: -s, y: -s, z: -s}, {x: s, y: s, z: -s}, {x: s, y: -s, z: s}, {x: -s, y: s, z: s});\n\n                    // Edges for Tet 1\n                    this.edges.push([0,1], [0,2], [0,3], [1,2], [1,3], [2,3]);\n                    // Edges for Tet 2\n                    this.edges.push([4,5], [4,6], [4,7], [5,6], [5,7], [6,7]);\n\n                } else if (this.shapeType === 'cylinders') {\n                    // Two intersecting rings/cylinders\n                    const r = 70;\n                    const segments = 24;\n                    // Ring 1\n                    for(let i=0; i<segments; i++) {\n                        const theta = (i/segments) * Math.PI * 2;\n                        this.points.push({ x: Math.cos(theta)*r, y: Math.sin(theta)*r, z: -30 });\n                        this.points.push({ x: Math.cos(theta)*r, y: Math.sin(theta)*r, z: 30 });\n                        // Connect segments\n                        let next = (i+1)%segments;\n                        this.edges.push([i*2, next*2], [i*2+1, next*2+1], [i*2, i*2+1]);\n                    }\n                     // Ring 2 (Perpendicular)\n                     let offset = this.points.length;\n                     for(let i=0; i<segments; i++) {\n                        const theta = (i/segments) * Math.PI * 2;\n                        this.points.push({ x: Math.cos(theta)*r, y: -30, z: Math.sin(theta)*r });\n                        this.points.push({ x: Math.cos(theta)*r, y: 30, z: Math.sin(theta)*r });\n                        let next = (i+1)%segments;\n                        this.edges.push([offset + i*2, offset + next*2], [offset + i*2+1, offset + next*2+1], [offset + i*2, offset + i*2+1]);\n                    }\n                } else if (this.shapeType === 'sphere') {\n                    // Icosahedron\n                    const t = (1.0 + Math.sqrt(5.0)) / 2.0;\n                    const s = 50;\n\n                    const p = [\n                        [-1,  t,  0], [ 1,  t,  0], [-1, -t,  0], [ 1, -t,  0],\n                        [ 0, -1,  t], [ 0,  1,  t], [ 0, -1, -t], [ 0,  1, -t],\n                        [ t,  0, -1], [ t,  0,  1], [-t,  0, -1], [-t,  0,  1]\n                    ];\n\n                    p.forEach(v => this.points.push({x: v[0]*s, y: v[1]*s, z: v[2]*s}));\n\n                    // Edges (simplified connectivity for visual clutter)\n                    for(let i=0; i<this.points.length; i++){\n                        for(let j=i+1; j<this.points.length; j++){\n                            let d = Math.hypot(this.points[i].x - this.points[j].x, this.points[i].y - this.points[j].y, this.points[i].z - this.points[j].z);\n                            if(d < s*2.1) this.edges.push([i,j]);\n                        }\n                    }\n                    // Add nested shape for complexity\n                     p.forEach(v => this.points.push({x: v[0]*s*0.5, y: v[1]*s*0.5, z: v[2]*s*0.5}));\n                     let off = 12;\n                     for(let i=0; i<12; i++){\n                        for(let j=i+1; j<12; j++){\n                            let d = Math.hypot(this.points[off+i].x - this.points[off+j].x, this.points[off+i].y - this.points[off+j].y, this.points[off+i].z - this.points[off+j].z);\n                            if(d < s*1.1) this.edges.push([off+i,off+j]);\n                        }\n                        this.edges.push([i, off+i]); // connect layers\n                     }\n\n                }\n            }\n\n            project(p) {\n                // Rotation\n                let x = p.x * Math.cos(this.angleY) - p.z * Math.sin(this.angleY);\n                let z = p.z * Math.cos(this.angleY) + p.x * Math.sin(this.angleY);\n                let y = p.y * Math.cos(this.angleX) - z * Math.sin(this.angleX);\n                z = z * Math.cos(this.angleX) + p.y * Math.sin(this.angleX);\n\n                // Perspective\n                let fov = 400;\n                let scale = fov / (fov + z);\n                return { x: x * scale + this.cx, y: y * scale + this.cy, z: z };\n            }\n\n            animate() {\n                this.ctx.clearRect(0, 0, this.width, this.height);\n                this.angleY += 0.005;\n                this.angleX += 0.002;\n\n                this.ctx.lineWidth = 0.8;\n                this.ctx.strokeStyle = '#52525b'; // Zinc-600\n\n                // Project Points\n                let projected = this.points.map(p => this.project(p));\n\n                // Draw Edges\n                this.edges.forEach(e => {\n                    let p1 = projected[e[0]];\n                    let p2 = projected[e[1]];\n                    // Depth fog\n                    let depth = (p1.z + p2.z) / 2;\n                    let alpha = Math.max(0.1, (1 - (depth / 200)));\n\n                    this.ctx.beginPath();\n                    this.ctx.moveTo(p1.x, p1.y);\n                    this.ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);\n                    this.ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha * 0.4})`;\n                    this.ctx.stroke();\n                });\n\n                // Draw Nodes\n                projected.forEach(p => {\n                    let alpha = Math.max(0.1, (1 - (p.z / 200)));\n                    if (alpha > 0.5) {\n                        this.ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${alpha})`;\n                        this.ctx.fillRect(p.x-1, p.y-1, 2, 2);\n                    }\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(() => this.animate());\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Initialize animations on load\n        window.onload = () => {\n            new WireframeEngine('canvas1', 'cube');\n            new WireframeEngine('canvas2', 'cylinders');\n            new WireframeEngine('canvas3', 'sphere');\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-architects.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aether-architects.jpg", "source_name": "aether-architects-DESIGN.md", "views": 168, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:15:52.561109+00:00"}